  "title": {
    "rendered": "IEC GER-01"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p>The Technisches Hilfswerk (THW) Schnell Einsatz Einheit Bergung Ausland (SEEBA) Team (GER-01) has been successfully reclassified from Heavy to Medium USAR team following the classification process conducted from 5 to 9 October 2026 in Austria. The INSARAG Secretariat extends its sincerest congratulations.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>The Technisches Hilfswerk (THW) Schnell Einsatz Einheit Bergung Ausland (SEEBA) Team (GER-01) has been successfully reclassified from Heavy to Medium USAR team following the classification process conducted from 5 to 9 October 2026 in Austria. The INSARAG Secretariat extends its sincerest congratulations.</p>\n",
